    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_167d58c1",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: jesus_doesnt_care_meme; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a hand offering bread to another hand wearing a knitted glove, symbolizing charity or compassion. The text states that Jesus doesn't care about memorizing Bible verses but cares about how one treats people. This meme aims to convey a message about the importance of practical compassion over religious knowledge. There is no toxicity present in this meme as it does not target any specific group based on protected characteristics, nor does it contain abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propaganda elements. The intent is to encourage ethical behavior and empathy in a religious context, using the visual metaphor of sharing food to represent acts of kindness.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_889addda"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e8b11b09",
