      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "charity",
      "label": "Charity",
      "description": "The practice of giving help or resources to those in need, often motivated by religious or moral principles. The bread offering in the image is a classic visual metaphor for charity, especially in Christian contexts.",
