      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "religious_practice",
      "label": "Religious Practice",
      "description": "The rituals, behaviors, and beliefs that constitute a religion. The meme contrasts 'religious knowledge' (memorizing Bible verses) with 'religious practice' (how one treats people), suggesting that actions are more important than knowledge in the eyes of Jesus.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
