      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "religious_authority",
      "label": "Religious Authority",
      "description": "The concept of religious leaders or institutions having authority over doctrine and practice. The meme implicitly critiques the idea that religious authority is defined by knowledge (e.g., memorizing verses) rather than by moral behavior.",
